-- Rollback for iso-14004-md-verification-pack.sql (2026-09-05).
-- Reverts ONLY rows this pack touched (identified by the verification_note tag) and ONLY for standard ISO-14004
-- (joined through worksheet_templates -> standards.code). Prior status was UNIFORM in the 2026-09-05 export:
-- all 65 fields imported_unverified (64 quoted -> verified_against_standard, 1 app/project metadata
-- (organisation_name) -> inferred_from_worksheet, 0 residue), so every field returns to imported_unverified;
-- quote/note/verified_at were null before the pack and are nulled again.
-- ISO-14004 has 0 equations in prod, so there is no equation section here.
-- Gates are untouched by the pack; the STAGED file was never applied; the encode-time source_quote column is
-- separate and stays.

-- ---- fields: 65 rows — prior status = imported_unverified ----
